=== Prompt ===
Who is Donald Trump?

=== Response ===
Donald Trump is a businessman, television personality, and politician who served as the 45th President of the United States from January 20, 2017, to January 20, 2021. Prior to his presidency, he was a real estate mogul and hosted the reality TV show "The Apprentice." Trump was born on June 14, 1946, in Queens, New York City, and is a graduate of the Wharton School of the University of Pennsylvania. He is a member of the Republican Party and is known for his controversial policies and statements, particularly regarding immigration, trade, and foreign affairs. His presidency was marked by numerous investigations, impeachments, and protests, and he remains a polarizing figure in American politics.

